    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Oates Breheny Group are pleased to present this spacious five-bedroom detached residence, ideally located in the popular Heather View development in Tonaphubble, Sligo. Well positioned within a mature residential setting, this property offers generous accommodation over two storys and would suit a wide range of purchasers. On entering, the porch and entrance hallway lead through to the living room, which features an open fireplace with an electrical insert and a large window to the front allowing for an abundance of natural light. Further along is the sitting room/dining room, again with a feature fireplace and a beautiful archway leading into the kitchen. The kitchen has a tiled floor and ample fitted units, with a back hall providing access to the rear of the property. Completing the ground floor is a versatile, multifunctional room, ideal for use as a fifth bedroom or home office, with built-in storage and its own fully tiled ensuite. Upstairs, there are four further bedrooms, three of which are generous double rooms with built-in wardrobes. The master bedroom benefits from an ensuite, and a fully tiled family bathroom with a bath services the remaining bedrooms. Heather View is located close to Sligo Town Centre with local schools, ATU Sligo, Sligo University Hospital and a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants and sporting/recreational facilities including Doorly Park and Cleaveragh Sports Complex all within easy reach. Overall, this is a well-proportioned family home in an established and convenient residential location. To make an enquiry please contact Oates Breheny Group on 071-9140404."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall/Porch\r\n\r\nLiving room (4.25m x 4.09m)\r\nCarpet floor, Feature open fireplace with electrical insert, Decorative coving to the ceiling and centre rose, TV point.\r\n\r\nSitting Room/Dining room (3.32m x 2.92m)\r\nCarpet floor, Feature open fireplace with electrical insert, Decorative coving to ceiling, Archway to kitchen, TV Point.\r\n\r\nKitchen (3.51m x 3.10m)\r\nTiled floor and between units, Fully fitted kitchen with integrated electric oven, hob and extractor fan, Integrated dishwasher.\r\n\r\nBack Hall (2.84m x 1.07m)\r\nTiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1/Office (3.54m x 3.18m)\r\nDouble room carpet floor, Sliding wardrobes, Built in shelves, TV point.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite (2.51m x 2.11m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, Electric shower, WC, WHB, Under sink unit.\r\n\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.92m x 3.24m)\r\nDouble room, Carpet floor, Built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite (3.23m x 2.26m)\r\nShower, WC, WHB.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (3.88m x 3.30m)\r\nDouble room, New carpet floor, Built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (3.87m x 3.30m)\r\nDouble room, Carpet floor, Built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 5 (2.81m x 2.70m)\r\nSingle room, Carpet floor Built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.80m x 2.82m)\r\nFully tiled floor to ceiling, Bath, WC, WHB, Under sink unit."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "• Oil fired central heating.\r\n• PVC Triple glazed windows.\r\n• Porch to front.\r\n• Regency 6 panel doors.\r\n• Understairs storage.\r\n• Sheds to rear.\r\n• Downstairs WC and bedroom.\r\n• Stira to attic.\r\n• Outside tap.\r\n• Brick paved driveway with drainage.\r\n• A short drive to Sligo Town Centre and close to a number of supermarkets, healthcare facilities and schools.\r\n• Exclusive location close to Doorly Park and Cleveragh recreational park and retail park."
      },
